      "reason": "archived, not invalidated: holdout AUDIT-2026-09-13-E was generated from exactly this production state, and its sealed blind review is the evidence RC2.5 calibrates against. The review found 53 of 82 delivered HARD items overclassified and 37 of 116 MEDIUM items easy, so production necessarily moves past it: nineteen structures demoted out of HARD, ten out of MEDIUM, one promotion correcting a factually wrong rationale, and two splits. Kept so Holdout E's provenance stays checkable.",
